{'post_id': 679, 'day': 252, 'content': "ugh okay so i've been using novamind for like 3 months now and the support has genuinely gotten WORSE 😅 not better. first few weeks were solid but now? it takes them 2-3 days to respond to basic questions and half the time they're just sending me generic answers that don't even address what i asked 💀\n\nlike i'm a student on a budget—i chose this tool specifically because it was affordable, but if i'm gonna pay for something i at least need actual help when things break. can't afford to wait 48+ hours while working on deadlines 😭\n\nreally disappointed bc the ai itself is fine but the support experience is making me regret the subscription ngl. might have to shop around again #NotWorthIt #StudentLife"}
